      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0061006900730020006100760061006E0074002000E70061002C0020006A006500200064006F006900730020007200E90067006C0065007200200075006E002000700072006F0062006C00E8006D0065002E002E002E00100002011401AB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il me faut un Pokémon courtois et propre sur lui\nqui m’aidera à servir mes super galettes Illumis !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il doit être au diapason, comme un majordome\ndigne de représenter Le Café des Compères !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est peut-être un peu passé de mode, mais\nc’est ça aussi, l’esprit des « Compères » !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hum, je m’égare...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nJe disais donc : je veux un Pokémon très courtois\npour servir mes super galettes aux clients.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 120
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un Wimessir fera parfaitement l’affaire !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nJ’aimerais donc que tu m’en confies un.\nJe t’en prie ! Tu es mon seul espoir !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 128
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Peux-tu me donner ton Wimessir\nle plus courtois ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006500750078002D007400750020006D006500200064006F006E006E0065007200200074006F006E002000570069006D00650073007300690072000A006C006500200070006C0075007300200063006F007500720074006F006900730020003F00100002011401AB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "OK !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F004B002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pas tout de suite...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500061007300200074006F00750074002000640065002000730075006900740065002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh ! Si tu as un Wimessir super courtois,\nnotre succès est assuré !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00680020002100200053006900200074007500200061007300200075006E002000570069006D0065007300730069007200200073007500700065007200200063006F007500720074006F00690073002C000A006E006F0074007200650020007300750063006300E80073002000650073007400200061007300730075007200E90020002100100002011401AB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Donne-moi un Wimessir super courtois !\nJe t’en prie ! Tu es mon seul espoir !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si seulement j’avais un Pokémon\ncourtois, comme un Wimessir...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300690020007300650075006C0065006D0065006E00740020006A20190061007600610069007300200075006E00200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E000A0063006F007500720074006F00690073002C00200063006F006D006D006500200075006E002000570069006D00650073007300690072002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
