      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh ! Je le sais ! Je le sens !\nC’est un Wimessir super courtois !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002000210020004A00650020006C006500200073006100690073002000210020004A00650020006C0065002000730065006E007300200021000A0043201900650073007400200075006E002000570069006D0065007300730069007200200073007500700065007200200063006F007500720074006F006900730020002100100002011401AB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh ! C’est un Wimessir femelle !\nEt je sens qu’elle va faire des étincelles !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Le grand moment est arrivé. Il est temps d’ajouter\nune touche de « super » à cette Galette Illumis !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Faites place à la Gigalette Illumis !\nEh oui : qu’est-ce qui est mieux que « méga » ?<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n« Giga », pardi ! En voilà une idée de gigagénie !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 144
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Wimessir, à toi ! Sers donc ma toute nouvelle\nGigalette Illumis à notre client<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah, zut... Les galettes sont si grandes\nqu’il n’y a plus de place pour poser le café...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je crois que j’ai gigagaffé...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A0065002000630072006F0069007300200071007500650020006A20190061006900200067006900670061006700610066006600E9002E002E002E00100002011401AB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bon, tout n’est pas perdu. Au moins, on a appris\nque Wimessir était un Pokémon ultra courtois !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
